---
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-28 relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14">
      <!-- Left: Section Title -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 reveal-left">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">About Me</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading" style="color: var(--text);">
          Passionate about uncovering stories hidden in complex data
        </h2>
        <div class="section-line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Text Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 reveal-right">
        <div class="space-y-3.5 sm:space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
          <p>
            I am an <strong style="color: var(--text);">Information Systems</strong> undergraduate student at
            <strong style="color: var(--text);"> Telkom University Surabaya</strong> with a dedicated focus on
            data analytics, statistical modeling, and business intelligence.
            Maintaining a <strong class="gradient-text font-bold">GPA of 3.86 / 4.00</strong>, I balance
            rigorous academic performance with hands-on technical and leadership roles.
          </p>
          <p>
            My analytics journey centers on transforming complex numbers into compelling stories that drive decisive business value.
            I have achieved multiple <strong style="color: var(--text);">Google Professional Certifications</strong> in
            Advanced Data Analytics and AI, and gained practical experience guiding students through end-to-end data mining lifecycles as a Teaching Assistant.
          </p>
          <p>
            I specialize in wrangling unstructured datasets, building predictive analytics, and engineering intuitive Tableau dashboards that empower executive decision-making. Always enthusiastic about solving challenging data problems and bringing measurable impact to data-driven teams.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Highlight tags -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 pt-5 sm:pt-7">
          {
            ["Python & Pandas", "SQL & Database Querying", "Tableau BI", "Machine Learning", "Data Mining", "Statistical Inference"].map((item) => (
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 shadow-sm"
                style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, var(--bg-surface)); color: var(--accent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 25%, var(--border));"
              >
                {item}
              </span>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
